msgid ""
"Everyone who has filed an issue, sent feedback, or simply tried Ditana and "
"shared what worked or didn't."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"If you want to reach us: [support@ditana.org](mailto:support@ditana.org) for "
"anything at all, the [Discord channel](https://discord.gg/RgcdumdE9J) for a "
"conversation, and the issue trackers for [the installer](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-installer/issues), [the configuration](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-config/issues) and [the package pipeline](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-build/issues) when you have something specific."
